    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d713">

                <pb facs="0937" n="841" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg841"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jones to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Buenos Ayres</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-04-28"><hi rendition="#italic">April 28,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 497.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 491, of the 6th
                    instant, I have the honor to inclose herewith copy and translation of a note
                    from the minister of foreign relations of yesterday’s date, wherein in reply to
                    my note of the day before announcing that Congress has declared a state of war
                    to exist between the United States and Spain, he promptly advises me of his
                    Government’s attitude of neutrality.</p>
                <p>I also confirm on the overleaf my telegram of yesterday’s “date advising you of
                    this fact.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">François S. Jones.</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’Affaires ad interim.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d713-a1.xml" xpointer="d713-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
